"  information given.\n"
"  The suggested alternative is to define a custom target that combines the chosen constraints either\n"
"  from scratch, using [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) or [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"
